 "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta name=\"subject\" content=\"\"> <meta name=\"source\" content=\"新华网\"> <meta name=\"publishedtype\" content=\"1\"> <meta name=\"publishdate\" content=\"2026-10-06\"> <meta name=\"pagetype\" content=\"1\"> <meta name=\"filetype\" content=\"0\"> <meta name=\"contentid\" content=\"202610064643350fd612444395ff48af6259efc8\"> <meta name=\"catalogs\" content=\"01002007075\"> <meta name=\"author\" content=\"\"> <meta name=\"templateId\" content=\"9587a01d4f5042768563d1283001587b\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta name=\"source\" content=\"新华社\"> <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\"> <meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no\" name=\"viewport\"> <meta name=\"renderer\" content=\"webkit\"> <meta content=\"telephone=no\" name=\"format-detection\"> <meta content=\"email=no\" name=\"format-detection\"> <meta name=\"msapplication-tap-highlight\" content=\"no\"> <div data=\"datasource:202610064643350fd612444395ff48af6259efc8\" datatype=\"content\"><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Sports-Soccer-Mexico\"></div> <div><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Mexico loses Mora to ankle injury-\"></div> <div><meta property=\"og:url\"></div> <div><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Mexico loses Mora to ankle injury\"></div> <div><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"\"></div> <title>\r\n            Mexico loses Mora to ankle injury-Xinhua\r\n        </title> <meta content=\"article\" property=\"og:type\"> <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://imgs.news.cn/global/public/css/reset_nofont.css\"> <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://imgs.news.cn/global/lib/swiper/swiper3.4.2/swiper.min.css\"> <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://english.news.cn/detail/css/cb_english2021new.css\"> <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://english.news.cn/detail/css/cb_english2021_sanwu.css\"> <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://imgs.news.cn/detail/css/cb_videoPlayer.css\"> <script src=\"https://imgs.news.cn/global/lib/jq/jquery1.12.4/jquery1.12.4.min.js\"></script> <script src=\"https://res.wx.qq.com/open/js/jweixin-1.6.0.js\"></script> <script src=\"https://lib.news.cn/common/shareHttps.js\"></script></head> <body><script src=\"https://english.news.cn/detail/js/cb_en_topNav_v1.js\"></script> <div class=\"conBox\"><div class=\"conTop\" data=\"datasource:202610064643350fd612444395ff48af6259efc8\" datatype=\"content\"><h1>Mexico loses Mora to ankle injury</h1> <div class=\"infoBox clearfix\"><div class=\"info\"><p class=\"source\">Source: Xinhua</p> <p class=\"editor\">Editor: huaxia</p> <p class=\"time\">2026-10-06 10:43:15</p></div> <div id=\"partShare\" class=\"share bshare-custom icon-medium\"><a title=\"分享到Facebook\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"bshare-facebook\"></a> <a title=\"分享到Twitter\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"bshare-twitter\"></a> <a title=\"分享到微信\" href=\"\" class=\"bshare-weixin\"><div class=\"fxd-wx-ewm\"><img src=\"zxcode_202610064643350fd612444395ff48af6259efc8.jpg\"></div></a> <a title=\"分享到新浪微博\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"\" class=\"bshare-sinaminiblog\"></a></div></div></div> <div class=\"conLeft\"><div id=\"detail\" class=\"content\" data=\"datasource:202610064643350fd612444395ff48af6259efc8\" datatype=\"content\"><iframe marginheight=\"0\" frameborder=\"0\" allowtransparency=\"\" marginwidth=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" data_src=\"\" class=\"domPC live-iframe\" style=\"display:none;\"></iframe> <video tabindex=\"0\" controls=\"controls\" playsinline=\"true\" preload=\"auto\" x5-playsinline=\"true\" webkit-playsinline=\"true\" data_src=\"\" class=\"domMobile live-video\" style=\"display:none;\"></video> <div id=\"detailContent\"><p>   MEXICO CITY, Oct. 5 (Xinhua) -- Teenage midfielder Gilberto Mora will miss Mexico's friendly against Chile due to injury, the Mexican Football Federation (FMF) said on Monday.</p><p>   Mora suffered an ankle injury in Mexico's 1-1 draw with Colombia on Sept. 26 and subsequently missed Mexico's friendlies against Peru and the United States.</p><p>   The FMF did not provide details of the injury but confirmed in a social media post that the 17-year-old would return to his club Tijuana earlier than planned.</p><p>   It added that suspended left-back Mateo Chavez would return to Dutch club AZ Alkmaar.</p><p>   Mexico and Chile will meet in Los Angeles on Tuesday in their final match of the European transfer window.  <span style=\"color:#337fe5\">■</span></p></div> <div class=\"talk\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/XinhuaNewsAgency/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://english.news.cn/2021newxl/images/20210928_rightShareFb_v1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></li> <li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/XHNews\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://english.news.cn/2021newxl/images/20210928_rightShareTw_v1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></li> <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/ChinaViewTV\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://english.news.cn/2021newxl/images/20210928_rightShareYb_v1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div> <script src=\"https://english.news.cn/detail/js/cb_en_footNav.js\"></script> <div id=\"backTopBtn\" class=\"backtotop\"></div> <script src=\"https://english.news.cn/detail/js/footer.js\"></script> <div data=\"datasource:202610064643350fd612444395ff48af6259efc8\" datatype=\"content\"><div id=\"wxpic\" style=\"display:none;\"><img src=\"\"></div> <div id=\"wxtitle\" style=\"display:none;\">\r\n                Mexico loses Mora to ankle injury\r\n            </div></div> <script>\r\n        //微信分享图功能\r\n        var wxfxPic = $.trim($(\"#wxpic\").find(\"img\").attr(\"src\"));\r\n        var wxfxTit = $.trim($(\"#wxtitle\").html());\r\n        wxfxTit = wxfxTit.replace(\"&amp;\",\"&\");\r\n        var detaiWxPic = $(\"#wxsharepic\").attr(\"src\");\r\n        if (wxfxPic == \"\") {\r\n            wxfxPic = 'https://lib.news.cn/common/sharelogo.jpg';\r\n        } else {\r\n      